<p>CALL FEATURES: OPTIONAL REDEMPTION:</p>
<p>FOR EACH SERIAL MATURITY, NOTES MATURING ON SUCH MATURITY DATE SHALL BE SUBJECT TO OPTIONAL REDEMPTION, IN WHOLE OR IN PART, BY NJTC ON THE IMMEDIATELY PRECEDING INTEREST PAYMENT DATE OR ANY DATE THEREAFTER, WITHOUT PREMIUM OR PENALTY AT PAR PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST, BUT ONLY FROM GRANTS RECEIVED UNDER THE FFGA.</p>
